        def: "\"Healing\" works. A gentle, soothing subtype of slice-of-life built to relax the viewer, with nature, quiet routines, soft music and minimal conflict.",
        note: "Silence is part of the design. Resist the live-action instinct to fill pauses with ad-libs or walla.",
